Local modifications: source comments and Python docstrings were removed,
surrounding blank lines were normalized, and the Java client and server
source directories were combined under one src/ directory. Package names
and executable statements were preserved. Upstream explanatory READMEs
are not included in the benchmark inputs.

Exact upstream revisions, original paths, and source hashes are recorded
in SOURCES.json.
